Web source (THE specification)
  web/src/features/admin/components/devtools/ReferenceLinksSection.tsx
  A static responsive grid (grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4) of four Tesla
  Fleet-API reference links from REFERENCE_LINKS (constants.ts). Each: GlassPanel
  (hover) wrapping an external <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">, a cyan
  icon box (ICON_COLOR_MAP.cyan), the i18n title t(link.title), and the (truncated)
  URL. Data sources: useTranslation only — no fetch, no charts, no maps.
  i18n keys (exact, from source): devtools.ref.fleetOverview, .partnerEndpoints,
  .devPortal, .telemetryGuide. NOTE: web/src/i18n/en.json has NO devtools.ref.*
  entries, so react-i18next renders the raw key; the native catalog supplies the
  polished English copy under the exact keys (documented in .strings header).

Shipped files (allowed scope: apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/ReferenceLinksSection.*)
  ReferenceLinksSection.swift           — composed view: toolbar + state switch + responsive grid
  ReferenceLinksSection.Catalog.swift   — ReferenceLink + RefLinkTone + catalog (JSX order)
                                          + ReferenceLinksStrings (P1/S10 facade) + a11y builders
  ReferenceLinksSection.Adapter.swift   — ReferenceLinkRow + ReferenceLinkProjection (cached
                                          catalog → rows, safe http(s) URL validation) [pure]
  ReferenceLinksSection.Model.swift     — @Observable model (P1/S8) + telemetry seam (P1/S11)
                                          + RefConnection + Source protocol + InMemory source
  ReferenceLinksSection.Views.swift     — RefLinkCard / RefFreshnessChip / RefOfflineBanner / RefLinkSkeleton
  ReferenceLinksSection.Previews.swift  — loading / ready / empty / error / stale / offline
  ReferenceLinksSection.Tests.swift     — adapter + catalog + model + accessibility (26 tests)
  ReferenceLinksSection.strings         — 4 exact source keys + native chrome/a11y keys

States reproduced (every state renders — no hidden surfaces)
  loading (skeleton grid) · ready (link grid) · empty (TSEmptyState) ·
  error (TSErrorDisplay + retry) · stale (freshness chip + freshness window) ·
  offline (RefOfflineBanner; cached links stay visible).

